{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>青衣長安邨發生家居意外。今日（21日）上午11時51分，安清樓一名女住戶報案，指放在枱面、打算丟棄的老鼠藥，疑被兩歲男童誤服。</p><p>人員到場時男童清醒，由救護車送到瑪嘉烈醫院治理。</p><figure><img alt=\"男童被送到瑪嘉烈醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260721/1156224713136017408961350.jpeg/R6FRh_6dCMHU4LPqXjmi4DJVn7hYp5CtYGJEA2BiRAM\"/><figcaption>男童被送到瑪嘉烈醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"青衣長安邨。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260524/1135101038114639872602453.jpeg/VjI2qY7GGk8qwCfh2T6xbxDEgTZbzB6wP4IBJgWCASY\"/><figcaption>青衣長安邨。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T05:38:42.076201+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}